OL,3,AHurricane Isaias downgraded after
OL,4,Amaking landfall in Florida
OL,5,
OL,6,FHurricane Isaias, the first of the 2026
OL,7,FAtlantic season, made landfall on
OL,8,FFriday night along the northern Gulf
OL,9,FCoast of Florida, bringing with it
OL,10,Fheavy rains and powerful winds.
OL,12,FIsaias is still surging across
OL,13,Fsouth-eastern parts of the US, after
OL,14,Fbeing downgraded to a post-tropical
OL,15,Fcyclone, the BBC's US partner CBS News
OL,16,Freports.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
