OL,3,AHurricane Isaias downgraded after
OL,4,Amaking landfall in Florida
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of thousands of households in
OL,7,FFlorida, Alabama and Georgia are
OL,8,Fwithout power, and each state has
OL,9,Fissued a state of emergency amid
OL,10,Fwarnings of life-threatening storm
OL,11,Fsurges.
OL,13,FIsaias is one of three storm systems
OL,14,Faffecting North America this weekend,
OL,15,Fwith the two others hitting Mexico and
OL,16,FSouthern California in the El Nino
OL,17,Ffuelled warm waters of the Pacific
OL,18,FOcean.
